                          %mi U
                          %mi i
                        %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                        %msub
                          %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                          %mrow
                            %mi i
                            %mo ∈
                            %mi I
                      %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} (\Phi_i \in X(U_i))_{i \in I}
                  of plots, which are “
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/matching+families"}> matching families
                  ” in that they agree on
                  = succeed ":" do
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/intersections"} intersections
                .maruku-equation
                  %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                    %semantics
                      %mrow
                        %msub
                          %mi ϕ
                          %mi i
                        %msub
                          %mo{:stretchy => "false"} |
